{"id":"vod_bf_103618","vodId":"103618","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"野原广志午餐流派","name_cn":"野原广志午餐流派","date":"2025-01-01","year":"2025","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20251004-1/44ac2ba097e413ed25f295f898cc74be.jpg"},"summary":"原作漫画作者是塚原洋一，作品讲述了在《蜡笔小新》系列中未曾展现的、作为上班族为家庭工作的广志在有限的零花钱和时间中，对午餐的极致追求。广志不仅以美食评论的方式品尝美味，还包含了各种料理的冷知识和制作方法，以及上班族特有的“请后辈吃饭的烦恼”、“业务间隙的快餐”、“对上司的抱怨”等职场人士的共鸣点，因此得到了 20 至 30 岁男女的广泛共鸣。此外，该衍生作还融入了《蜡笔小新》特有的幽默，以及广志在品尝“热辣”、“辛辣”、“甜美”等不同料理时展现的各种“颜艺”。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-07-14 18:59:44","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.fengbao8.com/video/yeyuanguangzhiwucanliupai/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.fengbao8.com/video/yeyuanguangzhiwucanliupai/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.fengbao8.com/video/yeyuanguangzhiwucanliupai/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.fengbao8.com/video/yeyuanguangzhiwucanliupai/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.fengbao8.com/video/yeyuanguangzhiwucanliupai/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.fengbao8.com/video/yeyuanguangzhiwucanliupai/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.fengbao8.com/video/yeyuanguangzhiwucanliupai/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.fengbao8.com/video/yeyuanguangzhiwucanliupai/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.fengbao8.com/video/yeyuanguangzhiwucanliupai/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.baofeng9.com/video/yeyuanguangzhiwucanliupai/2a39ca3eb762/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.baofeng9.com/video/yeyuanguangzhiwucanliupai/c502c2e5513c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.baofeng9.com/video/yeyuanguangzhiwucanliupai/dbfd142427cc/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:16.697Z"}